# Credentials

Commands needing credentials run through the `faramir_run` MCP tool (CLI:
`faramir run`). Secrets are referenced by name; values are never available here
and output comes back with them replaced by `«SECRET:ref»`.

```
faramir_run(cmd=["printenv", "ROUTER_PW"],
            env_refs={"ROUTER_PW": "secret://home/router/admin"})
```

`faramir_list_secrets` lists available names, and `faramir_status` lists the
allowlist rules, which are what determines the commands you may run. The broker executes only committed
work from `/srv/faramir`: commit, then `faramir_sync`, then run.
